# PAM policy for elevation credential prompts (ADR 0012). When a standard user
# asks to run a program as administrator, the broker asks for an
# administrator's password and checks it here -- the same stacks as a console
# login, so elevation faces the same password rules and lockout. Authorisation
# (that the account is actually an administrator) is the broker's, not PAM's.
@include common-auth
@include common-account
